From 35bb2820ee5b0bf1e4e9963f1df39779db044d69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:23:57 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(design): SmallFlags dark identity derived from the
 brand icon

Centralized design system:
- tailwind tokens backed by CSS variables (rgb channels) in src/index.css
- single brand gradient (--sf-gradiente) used as signature only:
  primary CTA, brand marks, dividers, selected states, hero highlight
- button system (primary/secondary/tertiary/perigo, sm, disabled,
  aria-busy loading), cards, chips, status, alerts, form fields
- focus-visible ring, prefers-reduced-motion, removal of unused
  continuous animations

Brand:
- reusable <Marca/> component (header, footer, Portal-ready)
- icon asset at public/brand/smallflags-icon.png (+ favicon/touch sizes)

Restyled header, footer, Home, institutional primitives and Portal
navigation/dashboard. No routes, RPCs, services, migrations, pricing,
permissions or business rules changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015BkzR76bjjuDQnXyY86vgu
