From 3787c6b57ee8a91f6c508fc7f6e5f4e3a154e7a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:43:09 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(design): switch SmallFlags identity to a light theme

- Neutral tokens flipped to white background, cool gray surfaces and
  near-black text; same semantic names, so components follow centrally.
- Brand colors split in two families: AA-safe darker tones for text on
  white (ciano..magenta) and the exact icon colors (vivo-*) for fills,
  the gradient and decoration.
- Large-text gradient variant (--sf-gradiente-texto) keeps >= 3:1 on
  white; small text never uses the gradient.
- Muted text raised to >= 60% ink for AA on white; inputs on white with
  stronger border; light panel shadows; danger button with white text.

No routes, RPCs, services, migrations, pricing or business rules changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
